{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんたくさんのコメントありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/22/6415899/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"優しくて力強いコメントばかりで本当にうれしいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よしっ頑張るぞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はお台場合衆国のめざましライブでした(o^∀^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一周年という記念すべき日にあのステージに出させてもらい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にたくさんの方にお祝いしてもらえて幸せでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/22/6415899/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん、ありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/22/6415899/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブの最後の一年経ってみてのコメント、実は途中までしか言えてなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーへありがとうの後にまだ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんに感謝の気持ちを伝えたかったんです(ρ＿；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁ〜直接お礼を言いたかった(ToT)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今改めて送るので受け取ってください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(ノ・_・)・‥...━━━━アリガト☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わってからは33人全員でケーキを食べてお祝いしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/22/6415899/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は私達の3rdシングル「走れ！bicycle」の発売日"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/22/6415899/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方が手にとって聞いてくださるとうれしいなぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/22/6415899/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんの元にはもう届いてますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の中身は、標題曲の走れ！bicycleに加えて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっかちなかたつむり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"涙がまだ悲しみだった頃（Type-A）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人はなぜ走るのか?（Type-B）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"音が出ないギター（Type-C）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"海流の島よ（通常盤）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして「ぶらり旅」をテーマとした33人全員の個人PVも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それぞれに振り分けられて収録されています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに私のはType-Cです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部いい曲ですし一つ一つ心をこめてみんなで作ったので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どれも見てほしいな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/22/6415899/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チェックしてくださった方はぜひ感想も教えてくださいっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワクワクo(^-^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/22/6415899/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"走れ！bicycleのリップシーンを撮ってるときの写真です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして遅くなっちゃいましたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8/20まいやんのお誕生日でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/22/6415899/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヽ(*´∀｀)ノオメデトーッ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやんは優しいしノリもよくて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも一緒に遊んでもらってるので楽しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/22/6415899/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二十歳になるということでさらに大人な女性になっちゃうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/22/6415899/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんどんキレイになっていくんだろうなぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見守ってるよ。←どこから目線(￣ー￣)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもよろしくね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/22/6415899/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/erika.ikuta/img/2012/08/22/%E3%81%84%E3%81%8F%E3%81%9F10.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エリカ(。・∀・。)☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}